能开发工具实现多云统一运维；\n4.有AI大模型智能运维落地经验（故障预测、日志智能分析等），熟悉AI运维框架。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":"3年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-03-18T15:00:27","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"8e66306c-c40f-43f4-b947-a2360fb1bd7e","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":511118486,"PostDateInt":1768465429000,"PostDate":"2026-01-15T16:23:49","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"大模型开发工程师(J11038)","OrgId":3983207,"Org":"Skunk_南京","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["江苏省·南京市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"工作职责\n1、负责大模型（文本、图像、语音等多模态模型）推理引擎及服务的开发，支持自研及开源模型的快速部署和高性能推理\n2、结合大模型业务场景，优化模型落地过程中的性能问题，降低推理成本。包括但不限于：模型量化蒸馏，服务调度优化等\n3、负责开发和维护大模型MaaS服务，支持高并发调用场景\n4、负责大模型的国产化适配","Require":"任职资格\n1、硕士及以上学历，1年以上算法相关工程化经验。计算机、电子、自动化、软件等相关专业。 \n2、熟悉一种或多种LLM推理框架，有vllm、sglang、lmdeploy、TensorRT-LLM等相关经验优先。\n3、熟悉大模型调度优化技术，包括PD分离、多级缓存、多实例调度、负载均衡等，如SGLang model gateway、lm-d。\n4、熟悉大模型引擎优化技术，包括prefill cache、tensor并行优化等。有cuda或triton算子优化经验优先。\n5、有昇腾、海光、平头哥、沐曦等算力芯片适配经验优先","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"硕士研究生","YearsOfWorking":"1年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-01-15T16:23:49","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"52ce715a-d06a-4b24-81d3-7f4d4279b6fb","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":511118485,"PostDateInt":1768465331000,"PostDate":"2026-01-15T16:22:11","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"测试工程师（server端）(J11037)","OrgId":4003951,"Org":"IPA-PMO_南京","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["江苏省·南京市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1.负责公有云口语评测微服务、私有云ASR（自动语音识别）、TTS（语音合成）等核心语音引擎及相关服务的测试工作，涵盖功能、性能、兼容性、稳定性、安全性等全维度测试。\n2.参与项目需求分析与评审，制定详细的测试计划、测试方案，设计高质量的测试用例（含自动化测试脚本），确保测试覆盖全面性与有效性。\n3.执行测试用例，精准定位并记录公有云、私有云场景下的各类缺陷，跟踪缺陷生命周期，推动研发团队高效修复，确保问题闭环，保障产品质量。\n4.针对公有云服务的多环境（不同地域、不同配置）、高并发特性，开展性能测试、压力测试，分析测试结果，提出性能优化建议；针对私有云的部署场景差异，完成兼容性测试及适配验证。\n5.负责ASR/TTS引擎的核心算法效果测试，包括语音识别准确率、合成自然度、口语评测维度（发音、语调、流畅度等）的量化测试与效果验证，输出专业的测试报告。\n6.搭建和维护测试环境（含公有云测试实例、私有云模拟部署环境），维护测试数据（语音样本库、评测文本库等），提升测试效率。\n7.推动测试流程优化，参与自动化测试框架的搭建与落地，编写自动化测试脚本，提升回归测试效率，支撑产品快速迭代。\n8.配合产品、研发团队完成版本上线前的质量验收，输出测试总结报告；跟踪线上问题，协助定位分析，推动问题解决。","Require":"1.本科及以上学历，计算机相关专业，3年及以上软件测试经验，有公有云服务测试、ASR/TTS等语音引擎测试系统测试经验者优先；\n2.熟悉软件测试流程、测试方法和常用测试工具（如JIRA、TestRail、Postman等），具备独立制定测试计划、设计测试用例和执行测试的能力；\n3.了解公有云（如阿里云、腾讯云、华为云）基础架构和服务部署模式，熟悉私有云部署流程和环境配置，能独立搭建和维护相关测试环境；\n4.熟悉常见的Linux 操作系统，熟悉linux性能指标相关知识，熟悉常见信创操作系统，了解linux内核机制者优先；\n5.熟悉常见的网络协议，熟悉http，websocket等相关协议；\n6.具备一定的自动化测试能力，熟悉至少一种脚本语言（如Python、shell）；\n7.了解ASR/TTS核心原理，熟悉语音相关测试指标（如识别准确率、词错率、合成自然度等），有语音测试数据构建和管理经验者优先。\n8.具备良好的逻辑思维能力、问题定位能力和沟通协调能力，能清晰表达测试思路和问题反馈；有较强的责任心和抗压能力，适应快速迭代的项目节奏。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":"3年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-01-15T16:22:11","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliver